<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-NOVOTNA BEATS HINGIS IN WOMEN'S EUROPEAN INDOOR FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NOVOTNA BEATS HINGIS IN WOMEN'S EUROPEAN INDOOR FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final in the women's</p>
<p>European indoor championship on Sunday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>4-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat 5-Martina Hingis</p>
<p>(Switzerland) 6-2 6-2</p>
</text>
